[Mat](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d3/d63/classcv_1_1Mat.html) im_distorted(original_.[size](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d3/d63/classcv_1_1Mat.html#a146f8e8dda07d1365a575ab83d9828d1)(), original_.[type](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d3/d63/classcv_1_1Mat.html#af2d2652e552d7de635988f18a84b53e5)(), Scalar::all(0));
