// reconstruct the distorted image
// choose quality profile fast (xphoto::INPAINT_FSR_FAST) or best (xphoto::INPAINT_FSR_BEST)
[Mat](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d3/d63/classcv_1_1Mat.html) reconstructed;
