Once `opencv.js` is ready, you can access OpenCV objects and functions through `cv` object. The promise-typed `cv` object should be unwrap with `await` operator. See 
For example, you can create a [cv.Mat](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d3/d63/classcv_1_1Mat.html "n-dimensional dense array class") from an image by [cv.imread](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d4/da8/group__imgcodecs.html#gacbaa02cffc4ec2422dfa2e24412a99e2 "Loads an image from a file."). 

