#  Introduction
In this section, we introduce [cv::FaceDetectorYN](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/df/d20/classcv_1_1FaceDetectorYN.html "DNN-based face detector.") class for face detection and [cv::FaceRecognizerSF](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/da/d09/classcv_1_1FaceRecognizerSF.html "DNN-based face recognizer.") class for face recognition.
#  Models
There are two models (ONNX format) pre-trained and required for this module:
  *     * Size: 338KB
    * Results on WIDER Face Val set: 0.830(easy), 0.824(medium), 0.708(hard)
  *     * Size: 36.9MB
    * Results:

Database  | Accuracy  | Threshold (normL2)  | Threshold (cosine)   
---|---|---|---  
LFW  | 99.60%  | 1.128  | 0.363   
CALFW  | 93.95%  | 1.149  | 0.340   
CPLFW  | 91.05%  | 1.204  | 0.275   
AgeDB-30  | 94.90%  | 1.202  | 0.277   
CFP-FP  | 94.80%  | 1.253  | 0.212   
