    In the previous tutorial [Introduction to Support Vector Machines](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d1/d73/tutorial_introduction_to_svm.html) there is an explanation of the attributes of the class [cv::ml::SVM](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d1/d2d/classcv_1_1ml_1_1SVM.html) that we configure here before training the SVM.
