#  Introduction
In this tutorial you will learn:
  * How an existing algorithm can be transformed into a G-API computation (graph);
  * How to inspect and profile G-API graphs;
  * How to customize graph execution without changing its code.


This tutorial is based on [Anisotropic image segmentation by a gradient structure tensor](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d4/d70/tutorial_anisotropic_image_segmentation_by_a_gst.html).
