Every object is related to the network specified in its template argument. We should pass there the network type we have defined in in the early beginning of the tutorial.
Network parameters are then wrapped in `cv::gapi::NetworkPackage`:
auto [networks](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d4/d1c/namespacecv_1_1gapi.html#a7d2b842e9369c0d72b383e61b9038581) = [cv::gapi::networks](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d4/d1c/namespacecv_1_1gapi.html#a7d2b842e9369c0d72b383e61b9038581)(faceParams, landmParams);
