#  Goal
In this tutorial you will learn how to:
  * Use the [cv::FlannBasedMatcher](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/dc/de2/classcv_1_1FlannBasedMatcher.html) interface in order to perform a quick and efficient matching by using the [Clustering and Search in Multi-Dimensional Spaces](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/dc/de5/group__flann.html) module



