virtual bool open(const String &filename, int apiPreference=CAP_ANY)
Opens a video file or a capturing device or an IP video stream for video capturing.
To check if the binding of the class to a video source was successful or not use the [cv::VideoCapture::isOpened](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d8/dfe/classcv_1_1VideoCapture.html#a9d2ca36789e7fcfe7a7be3b328038585) function: 
