We need to know the frame size of a single image, in order to create an instance of a `QuasiDesnseStereo` object.
[cv::Size](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d6/d50/classcv_1_1Size__.html) frameSize = leftImg.[size](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d3/d63/classcv_1_1Mat.html#a146f8e8dda07d1365a575ab83d9828d1)();
