  1. **Assemble and configure Android OpenCL SDK.** The JNI part of the sample depends on standard Khornos OpenCL headers, and C++ wrapper for OpenCL and libOpenCL.so. The standard OpenCL headers may be copied from 3rdparty directory in OpenCV repository or you Linux distribution package. C++ wrapper is available in 
