#  Performance notes
To compare the performance we measured FPS of the same preview frames modification (_Laplacian_) done by C/C++ code (call to with ), by direct OpenCL calls (using OpenCL _images_ for input and output), and by OpenCV _T-API_ (call to with ) on _Sony Xperia Z3_ with 720p camera resolution:
  * **C/C++ version** shows **3-4 fps**
  * **direct OpenCL calls** shows **25-27 fps**
  * **OpenCV T-API** shows **11-13 fps** (due to extra copying from `cl_image` to `cl_buffer` and back)

