Features2d.drawMatches(imgObject, keypointsObject, imgScene, keypointsScene, goodMatches, imgMatches, [Scalar](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/dc/d84/group__core__basic.html#ga599fe92e910c027be274233eccad7beb).[all](https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d1/da0/classcv_1_1Scalar__.html#a9c7b78a3333aa12198cc332ca352d1dc)(-1),
